  <item>
    <title>迎万难，赢万难，郑钦文涅槃归来，美网八强含金量如何</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/6aad548eac389df82733feba</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">6aad548eac389df82733feba</guid>
    <pubDate>Fri, 18 Sep 2026 15:16:35 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>2026美网落幕，有人记住了冠军的荣光，但更多人记住了一个从资格赛一路杀穿、两次濒临崩盘、两次逆天翻盘的名字——郑钦文。</span></p><p><span>一年前高居世界第四，今年跌至百名开外；没人看好的低谷赛季，她在法拉盛蓝色硬地场上，打出了职业生涯最硬核、最动人的逆袭。今天我们聊聊：为什么这届美网八强，含金量胜过无数冠军？</span></p><p><span>【主要内容】</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="83">01:23</a> 互动问答</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="358">05:58</a> 坠落！无人知晓的低谷</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="800">13:20</a> 封神！2026美网全程涅槃之路</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1297">21:37</a> 为什么说这届八强，含金量远超巅峰战绩？</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1501">25:01</a> 郑钦文的归来，让我们依旧对她充满期待！</span></p><p></p><p><span>【关于本期】</span></p><p><span>主播：Joen</span></p><p><span>背景曲：那英《回声》</span></p><p></p><p><span>【收听平台】</span></p><p><a href="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/podcast/669cbe85840aaa3d81c8224c" data-url="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/podcast/669cbe85840aaa3d81c8224c"><span>小宇宙</span></a><span> ｜</span><a href="https://podcasts.apple.com/gb/podcast/%E4%BB%8A%E7%90%83%E8%AE%B2/id1769424162?i=1000670064595" data-url="https://podcasts.apple.com/gb/podcast/%E4%BB%8A%E7%90%83%E8%AE%B2/id1769424162?i=1000670064595"><span>苹果Podcast</span></a><span> | </span><a href="https://www.ximalaya.com/album/83674963" data-url="https://www.ximalaya.com/album/83674963"><span>喜马拉雅</span></a><span> ｜</span><a href="https://y.qq.com/n/ryqq/albumDetail/002QNDsY0kpOLq" data-url="https://y.qq.com/n/ryqq/albumDetail/002QNDsY0kpOLq"><span>QQ音乐</span></a><span> ｜</span><a href="https://music.163.com/#/djradio?id=1213620785" data-url="https://music.163.com/#/djradio?id=1213620785"><span>网易云音乐</span></a><span>｜</span><a href="https://www.douban.com/podcast/37220622/episodes" data-url="https://www.douban.com/podcast/37220622/episodes"><span>豆瓣</span></a><span> | </span><a href="https://feed.xyzfm.space/jkr43da47kq7" data-url="https://feed.xyzfm.space/jkr43da47kq7"><span>RSS订阅链接</span></a></p><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fn7omuhdJ5IDUu_Z