  <item>
    <title>20. 女排亚锦赛：中国输了，还是泰国赢了？</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/6a9d58c5f03e74ee6b05ed82</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">6a9d58c5f03e74ee6b05ed82</guid>
    <pubDate>Sun, 06 Sep 2026 12:15:58 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>五局鏖战，中国女排在亚锦赛决赛中<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="123">2:3</a>遗憾负于泰国，无缘直通洛杉矶奥运。这是一场偶然的失利，还是阵容与战术体系问题的集中暴露？</span></p><p><span>回顾全年，世联赛取得第四名，但二传和教练组的短板暴露无遗。虽然直通梦碎，但通往2028奥运的大门并未完全关闭。明年世界杯和后年的VNL分站赛，将是女排姑娘们证明自己的最后机会。</span></p><p><span>主教练赵勇是否该下课？二传位置该如何选人用人？新人能否扛起重任？</span></p><p><span>一切尽在本期节目。</span></p><p></p><p><span>【主要内容】</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="74">01:14</a> 快问快答</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="234">03:54</a> 亚锦赛的重要性和2028 年洛杉矶奥运会资格分配</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="536">08:56</a> VNL 赛季回顾，从分站赛第九名到总决赛第四名</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="718">11:58</a> 亚锦赛参赛名单，二传人选为何成为讨论焦点</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="858">14:18</a> 小组赛至半决赛，伊朗队带来的挑战与中国队暴露的波动</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1112">18:32</a> 决赛复盘，五局大战的走势与关键转折</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1584">26:24</a> 数据拆解，进攻端的差距与接应位置的低迷</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1776">29:36</a> 泰国队为何能够夺冠</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1989">33:09</a> 中国队的人员配置，二传梯队与接应替补问题</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2425">40:25</a> 训练与战术短板：体能、二传组织和副攻拦网</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2545">42:25</a> 亚运会阵容评论</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2672">44:32</a> 更新最终参赛名单</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2709">45:09</a> 奥运资格前景展望：世界杯和世界排名通道的竞争形势</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2960">49:20</a> 阵容现实：袁心玥、李盈莹和朱婷的情况</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3222">53:42</a> 未来两年的重点和赛季总结</span></p><p></p><p></p><p><span>【关于本期】</span></p><p><span>主播：Golden &amp; Joen</span></p><p><span>片头曲：《Ace Ace》</span></p><p><span>片尾曲：《Here comes the boom!》</span></p><p></p><p><span>【收听平台】</span></p><p><a href="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/podcast/669cbe85840aaa3d81c8224c" data-url="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/podcast/669cbe85840aaa3d81c8224c"><span>小宇宙</span></a><span> ｜</span><a href="https://podcasts.apple.com/gb/podcast/%E4%BB%8A%E7%90%83%E8%AE%B2/id1769424162?i=1000670064595" data-url="https://podcasts.apple.com/gb/podcast/%E4%BB%8A%E7%90%83%E8%AE%B2/id1769424162?i=1000670064595"><span>苹果Podcast</span></a><span> | </span><a href="https://www.ximalaya.com/album/83674963" data-url="https://www.ximalaya.com/album/83674963"><span>喜马拉雅</span></a><span> ｜</span><a href="https://y.qq.com/n/ryqq/albumDetail/002QNDsY0kpOLq" data-url="https://y.qq.com/n/ryqq/albumDetail/002QNDsY0kpOLq"><span>QQ音乐</span></a><span> ｜</span><a href="https://music.163.com/#/djradio?id=1213620785" data-url="https://music.163.com/#/djradio?id=1213620785"><span>网易云音乐</span></a><span>｜</span><a href="https://www.douban.com/podcast/37220622/episodes" data-url="https://www.douban.com/podcast/37220622/episodes"><span>豆瓣</span></a><span> | </span><a href="https://feed.xyzfm.space/jkr43da47kq7" data-url="https://feed.xyzfm.space/jkr43da47kq7"><span>RSS订阅链接</span></a></p><p></p><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FoD6HBIZ4kEccBZhC9M1uX-kZ2DW.png"><p><span>（泰国在第一时间获得奥运会门票）</span></p><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FjQ1n56RoXnltxJsIszEULMIb96p.png"><p><span>（中国女排功勋二传冯坤为中国女排颁奖）</span></p><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FlQhXTdCz4gVKEnkva0hZnL9S-xc.png"><p><span>（赛事最佳阵容合影：MVP——波蓬(泰国)，主攻——庄宇珊、萨斯帕蓬，接应——和田由纪子，副攻——王媛媛、塔达奥，二传——波蓬，自由人——王梦洁 ​​​）</span></p><p></p>]]></description>
