  <item>
    <title>三个球迷一台戏，聊聊我们的世界杯记忆</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/6a2d1ba34233e62bc549246b</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">6a2d1ba34233e62bc549246b</guid>
    <pubDate>Sat, 13 Jun 2026 09:29:36 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>2026美加墨世界杯来袭，本期《今球讲》播客，主播Golden邀请了两位嘉宾马德里和老丸子，一起追忆世界杯有关的个人回忆。</span></p><p><span>三位分别是什么时候开始看的世界杯？</span></p><p><span>哪些球员和瞬间让三位印象深刻、热血沸腾？</span></p><p><span>又有哪些场景让老三位意难平？</span></p><p><span>世界杯主题曲是世界杯的“开胃菜”，除了《生命之杯》《Waca Waca》，又有哪些曲目让大家印象深刻？</span></p><p><span>最后，三位会怎样预测本届世界杯的冠军和黑马，一切尽在本期节目。</span></p><p></p><p><span>世界杯是球迷的人生年轮，人生攒满了回忆就是幸福的。让我们接下来一起享受这个夏天，享受足球的魅力！</span></p><p></p><p><span>【主要内容】</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="135">00:02:15</a> 中国体育史上的收视率巅峰是哪场比赛</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="423">00:07:03</a> 探寻世界杯史上人口最少、国土最小的足球协会</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="628">00:10:28</a> 三位主播各自初次看世界杯的记忆</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="970">00:16:10</a> 各自世界杯记忆的高光瞬间和球员</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2420">00:40:20</a> 意难平，如果给出一个穿越改变结果的机会，三位分别会怎样选择</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2994">00:49:54</a> 世界杯主题曲哪些夯，哪些拉</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3295">00:54:55</a> 本届世界杯冠军预测！</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3966">01:06:06</a> 本届世界杯黑马预测</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4323">01:12:03</a> 开放话题讨论：足球是不是正在丧失吸引力</span></p><p></p><p><span>【关于本期】</span></p><p><span>主播：Golden</span></p><p><span>嘉宾：马德里 &amp; 老丸子</span></p><p></p><p><span>【收听平台】</span></p><p><a href="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/podcast/669cbe85840aaa3d81c8224c" data-url="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/podcast/669cbe85840aaa3d81c8224c"><span>小宇宙</span></a><span> ｜</span><a href="https://podcasts.apple.com/gb/podcast/%E4%BB%8A%E7%90%83%E8%AE%B2/id1769424162?i=1000670064595" data-url="https://podcasts.apple.com/gb/podcast/%E4%BB%8A%E7%90%83%E8%AE%B2/id1769424162?i=1000670064595"><span>苹果Podcast</span></a><span> | </span><a href="https://www.ximalaya.com/album/83674963" data-url="https://www.ximalaya.com/album/83674963"><span>喜马拉雅</span></a><span> ｜</span><a href="https://y.qq.com/n/ryqq/albumDetail/002QNDsY0kpOLq" data-url="https://y.qq.com/n/ryqq/albumDetail/002QNDsY0kpOLq"><span>QQ音乐</span></a><span> ｜</span><a href="https://music.163.com/#/djradio?id=1213620785" data-url="https://music.163.com/#/djradio?id=1213620785"><span>网易云音乐</span></a><span>｜</span><a href="https://www.douban.com/podcast/37220622/episodes" data-url="https://www.douban.com/podcast/37220622/episodes"><span>豆瓣</span></a><span> | </span><a href="https://feed.xyzfm.space/jkr43da47kq7" data-url="https://feed.xyzfm.space/jkr43da47kq7"><span>RSS订阅链接</span></a></p>]]></description>
