  <item>
    <title>斯诺克往事：从丁俊晖到赵心童、吴宜泽</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/6a222de7b30e1571aea0e953</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">6a222de7b30e1571aea0e953</guid>
    <pubDate>Fri, 05 Jun 2026 02:09:48 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>中国选手赵心童和吴宜泽在斯诺克世锦赛中的历史性夺冠，打破了英国选手的长期垄断。</span></p><p><span>在本期播客中，今球讲迎来了史上首位嘉宾热心听众马德里，共同探讨中国斯诺克的历史与崛起。</span></p><p><span>我们回顾了丁俊晖、赵心童、吴宜泽从小到大的成长故事，他们如何在逆境中不断强大，改变人们对台球这项运动的看法。</span></p><p><span>相信一代又一代的台球人薪火相传，未来会谱写更精彩的传奇！</span></p><p></p><p><span>【节目内容】</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="149">00:02:29</a>:回顾赵心童与吴宜泽不可思议的斯诺克冠军之旅</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="322">00:05:22</a>:主播和嘉宾分享各自的台球记忆</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="659">00:10:59</a>:回顾丁俊晖的成长历程：一个父亲的赌博、家庭的牺牲与丁俊晖的逆袭</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="988">00:16:28</a>:中国公开赛上的惊人胜利：丁俊晖击败亨德利，引领斯诺克热潮</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1646">00:27:26</a>:中国斯诺克领军人物丁俊晖</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1826">00:30:26</a>:赵心童的成长历程：从一帆风顺到禁赛风波，再到世锦赛夺冠</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2040">00:34:00</a>:假球禁赛始末，斯诺克行业内的赌博问题缘由探讨</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2968">00:49:28</a>:天才少年吴宜泽的成长故事</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3289">00:54:49</a>:回顾吴宜泽斯诺克世锦赛夺冠历程</span></p><p></p><p><span>【关于本期】</span></p><p><span>主播：Joen &amp; Golden</span></p><p><span>嘉宾：马德里</span></p><p><span>片尾曲：蔡依林 - 马德里不可思议</span></p><p></p><p><span>【收听平台】</span></p><p><a href="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/podcast/669cbe85840aaa3d81c8224c" data-url="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/podcast/669cbe85840aaa3d81c8224c"><span>小宇宙</span></a><span> ｜</span><a href="https://podcasts.apple.com/gb/podcast/%E4%BB%8A%E7%90%83%E8%AE%B2/id1769424162?i=1000670064595" data-url="https://podcasts.apple.com/gb/podcast/%E4%BB%8A%E7%90%83%E8%AE%B2/id1769424162?i=1000670064595"><span>苹果Podcast</span></a><span> | </span><a href="https://www.ximalaya.com/album/83674963" data-url="https://www.ximalaya.com/album/83674963"><span>喜马拉雅</span></a><span> ｜</span><a href="https://y.qq.com/n/ryqq/albumDetail/002QNDsY0kpOLq" data-url="https://y.qq.com/n/ryqq/albumDetail/002QNDsY0kpOLq"><span>QQ音乐</span></a><span> ｜</span><a href="https://music.163.com/#/djradio?id=1213620785" data-url="https://music.163.com/#/djradio?id=1213620785"><span>网易云音乐</span></a><span>｜</span><a href="https://www.douban.com/podcast/37220622/episodes" data-url="https://www.douban.com/podcast/37220622/episodes"><span>豆瓣</span></a><span> | </span><a href="https://feed.xyzfm.space/jkr43da47kq7" data-url="https://feed.xyzfm.space/jkr43da47kq7"><span>RSS订阅链接</span></a></p><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FvulUmxdXpMgq0EKVy893_1mMaWV.jpg"></figure><p><span>（丁俊晖、吴宜泽、赵心童同框）</span></p><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fr_2vRnT9RLa8kB5ChbfEtPnKY33.jpg"></figure><p><span>（赵心童2025年世锦赛夺冠）</span></p><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FrubTzAZ7iBvhrL4bIRN8f0cOOd1.jpg"></figure><p><span>（见证传承，2026年世锦赛赵心童<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="789">13:9</a>战胜丁俊晖，晋级八强）</span></p><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fp2H9wcs_SuXdP-NZWrDgdcnXtUX.png"></figure><p><span>（吴宜泽世锦赛夺冠）</span></p>]]></description>
