  <item>
    <title>乘风破浪的王濛</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/69ef8da6b4f25397f5b94b9c</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">69ef8da6b4f25397f5b94b9c</guid>
    <pubDate>Mon, 27 Apr 2026 18:10:23 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>她，是中国短道速滑的传奇；</span></p><p><span>她，是新闻里桀骜不驯的争议人物；</span></p><p><span>她，是赛场边专业和率真的解说员；</span></p><p><span>她，是综艺里乘风破浪的唱跳Rapper.</span></p><p><span>她就是王濛，本期节目带大家回顾一代霸主王濛的成长历程、运动员生涯、短暂的教练生涯和退役后的生活。</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="120">02:00</a> 回顾王濛运动员的职业生涯的众多“第一个”</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="321">05:21</a> 两位主播不约而同的冬奥会最难忘的瞬间</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="572">09:32</a> 中国短道速滑队从1998年到2026年八届冬奥会的起落沉浮</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="783">13:03</a> 王濛儿时的成长之路</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1069">17:49</a> 2002年遗憾落选盐湖城冬奥会名单</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1230">20:30</a> 王濛的首届冬奥会之旅：五百米项目中的统治地位</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1493">24:53</a> 中国短道速滑队短暂低谷，终绽放温哥华</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2093">34:53</a> 还原“队内”冲突真相，王濛被开除国家队，禁赛14月之久</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2795">46:35</a> 造化弄人，索契冬奥会前王濛重伤，遗憾结束职业生涯</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2942">49:02</a> 短暂的国家队教练经历</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3205">53:25</a> “我的眼睛就是尺”，解说员王濛出圈北京冬奥会</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3431">57:11</a>乘风破浪的王濛</span></p><p><span>【关于本期】</span></p><p><span>主播：Joen &amp; Golden</span></p><p><span>片尾曲：李小冉/王濛/唐艺昕 - 心愿便利贴 (Live)</span></p><p><span>【收听平台】</span></p><p><a href="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/podcast/669cbe85840aaa3d81c8224c" data-url="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/podcast/669cbe85840aaa3d81c8224c"><span>小宇宙</span></a><span> ｜</span><a href="https://podcasts.apple.com/gb/podcast/%E4%BB%8A%E7%90%83%E8%AE%B2/id1769424162?i=1000670064595" data-url="https://podcasts.apple.com/gb/podcast/%E4%BB%8A%E7%90%83%E8%AE%B2/id1769424162?i=1000670064595"><span>苹果Podcast</span></a><span> | </span><a href="https://www.ximalaya.com/album/83674963" data-url="https://www.ximalaya.com/album