    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>2025年男篮亚洲杯落下帷幕，中国男篮在比赛中顽强拼搏，战术得当，时隔十年再进亚洲杯决赛，最终1分惜败澳大利亚，获得亚军。</span></p><span></span><p><span>新一代男篮展现出的意志品质和战术执行力令人欣喜，本期不定期放送，聊聊男篮。</span></p><span></span><p><span>【主要内容】</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="52">00:52</a> 男篮亚洲杯中国队表现回顾</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="183">03:03</a> 决赛点评</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="464">07:44</a> 男篮亚洲杯与世界杯、奥运资格</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="819">13:39</a> 澳大利亚队加入男篮亚洲杯的意义</span></p><span></span><p><span>【关于本期】</span></p><span></span><p><span>主播：Joen</span></p><span></span><p><span>音乐：南征北战《骄傲的少年》</span></p><span></span><p><span>【收听平台】</span></p><span></span><p><a href="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/podcast/669cbe85840aaa3d81c8224c" data-url="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/podcast/669cbe85840aaa3d81c8224c"><span>小宇宙</span></a><span> ｜</span><a href="https://podcasts.apple.com/gb/podcast/%E4%BB%8A%E7%90%83%E8%AE%B2/id1769424162?i=1000670064595" data-url="https://podcasts.apple.com/gb/podcast/%E4%BB%8A%E7%90%83%E8%AE%B2/id1769424162?i=1000670064595"><span>苹果Podcast</span></a><span> | </span><a href="https://www.ximalaya.com/album/83674963" data-url="https://www.ximalaya.com/album/83674963"><span>喜马拉雅</span></a><span> ｜</span><a href="https://y.qq.com/n/ryqq/albumDetail/002QNDsY0kpOLq" data-url="https://y.qq.com/n/ryqq/albumDetail/002QNDsY0kpOLq"><span>QQ音乐</span></a><span> ｜</span><a href="https://music.163.com/#/djradio?id=1213620785" data-url="https://music.163.com/#/djradio?id=1213620785"><span>网易云音乐</span></a><span>｜</span><a href="https://www.douban.com/podcast/37220622/episodes" data-url="https://www.douban.com/podcast/37220622/episodes"><span>豆瓣</span></a><span> | </span><a href="https://feed.xyzfm.space/jkr43da47kq7" data-url="https://feed.xyzfm.space/jkr43da47kq7"><span>RSS订阅链接</span></a></p>]]></description>
