    <title>新启程，主帅赵勇其人和新一届女排国家队</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/686c0f1393fd2d72b805a193</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">686c0f1393fd2d72b805a193</guid>
    <pubDate>Mon, 07 Jul 2025 20:18:44 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>2025 年，中国女排正式迈入洛杉矶奥运周期，前辽宁女排主帅赵勇出任中国女排主教练，同时带来了一份年轻的新国家队队员大名单。</span></p><span></span><p><span>从选帅背后的纠结，到赵勇的执教思路；从二传位置的 “三小花”，到主攻线的 “潜力对决”—— 锁定本期播客，听Golden与 Joen 掰开了聊：洛杉矶周期，中国女排这盘 “新棋”，到底怎么下！</span></p><span></span><p><span>【主要内容】</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="63">01:03</a> 选帅背景与时间线</span></p><span></span><h3><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="300">05:00</a> 赵勇执教履历介绍</span></h3><span></span><h3><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="722">12:02</a> 新国家队大名单特点与二传位置分析</span></h3><span></span><h3><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1068">17:48</a> 主攻位置新人介绍</span></h3><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1394">23:14</a> 副攻位置新人介绍</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1738">28:58</a> 接应位置球员介绍</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2122">35:22</a> 自由人位置球员介绍</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2217">36:57</a> 2025年女排主要的精彩赛事预告</span></p><span></span><p><span>【关于本期】</span></p><span></span><p><span>主播：Golden &amp; Joen</span></p><span></span><p><span>片头：山寨林俊杰《旧曲新歌》</span></p><span></span><p><span>片尾：Joen《最初的梦想》</span></p><span></span><p><span>【收听平台】</span></p><span></span><p><a href="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/podcast/669cbe85840aaa3d81c8224c" data-url="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/podcast/669cbe85840aaa3d81c8224c"><span>小宇宙</span></a><span> ｜</span><a href="https://podcasts.apple.com/gb/podcast/%E4%BB%8A%E7%90%83%E8%AE%B2/id1769424162?i=1000670064595" data-url="https://podcasts.apple.com/gb/podcast/%E4%BB%8A%E7%90%83%E8%AE%B2/id1769424162?i=1000670064595"><span>苹果Podcast</span></a><span> | </span><a href="https://www.ximalaya.com/album/83674963" data-url="https://www.ximalaya.com/album/83674963"><span>喜马拉雅</span></a><span> ｜</span><a href="https://y.qq.com/n/ryqq/albumDetail/002QNDsY0kpOLq" data-url="https://y.qq.com/n/ryqq/albumDetail/002QNDsY0kpOLq"><span>QQ音乐</span></a><span> ｜</span><a href="https://music.163.com/#/djradio?id=1213620785" data-url="https://music.163.com/#/djradio?id=1213620785"><span>网易云音乐</span></a><span>｜</span><a href="https://www.douban.com/podcast/37220622/episodes" data-url="https://www.douban.com/podcast/37220622/episodes"><span>豆瓣</span></a><span> | </span><a href="https://feed.xyzfm.space/jkr43da47kq7" data-url="https://feed.xyzfm.space/jkr43da47kq7"><span>RSS订阅链接</span></a></p>]]></description>
