  <item>
    <title>十分钟读懂VNL：世界排球联赛的前世今生</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/6857a0bf2a38b4d979e041fe</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">6857a0bf2a38b4d979e041fe</guid>
    <pubDate>Sun, 22 Jun 2025 06:23:19 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>VNL世界排球联赛究竟有什么魅力吸引全球关注？</span></p><span></span><p><span>本期金球奖播客进行了一些调整，推出短时节目的新形式以提高更新频率，回应听众反馈。节目介绍了排球国家联赛（VNL）的历史与现状，从商业模式到赛事结构，分析了VNL如何取代传统大奖赛，提升竞技水平与观众体验。VNL不仅为参赛球队提供了更高的奖金，还通过全球化推广加强了排球的国际影响力。</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="20">00:20</a> 对于节目推出10min形式的短节目说明</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="166">02:46</a> VNL世界排球联赛举办机制和赛制简介</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="290">04:50</a> VNL的前世世界女排大奖赛简介</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="360">06:00</a> 从竞技层面比较VNL和女排世界大奖赛</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="435">07:15</a> 从商业和转播层面剖析VNL的革新</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="525">08:45</a> 从全球化推广层面看VNL</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="575">09:35</a> 介绍VNL和排名积分、奥运入场券的深度绑定</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="714">11:54</a> 中国女排在女排大奖赛和VNL的战绩介绍</span></p><span></span><p><span>【关于本期】</span></p><span></span><p><span>主播：Golden</span></p><span></span><p><span>片头&amp;片尾&amp;插曲：卡皮吧啦之歌《Capybara》</span></p><span></span><p><span>【收听平台】</span></p><span></span><p><a href="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/podcast/669cbe85840aaa3d81c8224c" data-url="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/podcast/669cbe85840aaa3d81c8224c"><span>小宇宙</span></a><span> ｜</span><a href="https://podcasts.apple.com/gb/podcast/%E4%BB%8A%E7%90%83%E8%AE%B2/id1769424162?i=1000670064595" data-url="https://podcasts.apple.com/gb/podcast/%E4%BB%8A%E7%90%83%E8%AE%B2/id1769424162?i=1000670064595"><span>苹果Podcast</span></a><span> | </span><a href="https://www.ximalaya.com/album/83674963" data-url="https://www.ximalaya.com/album/83674963"><span>喜马拉雅</span></a><span> ｜</span><a href="https://y.qq.com/n/ryqq/albumDetail/002QNDsY0kpOLq" data-url="https://y.qq.com/n/ryqq/albumDetail/002QNDsY0kpOLq"><span>QQ音乐</span></a><span> ｜</span><a href="https://music.163.com/#/djradio?id=1213620785" data-url="https://music.163.com/#/djradio?id=1213620785"><span>网易云音乐</span></a><span>｜</span><a href="https://www.douban.com/podcast/37220622/episodes" data-url="https://www.douban.com/podcast/37220622/episodes"><span>豆瓣</span></a><span> | </span><a href="https://feed.xyzfm.space/jkr43da47kq7" data-url="https://feed.xyzfm.space/jkr43da47kq7"><span>RSS订阅链接</span></a></p>]]></description>
